Medium detailed 3d model of cartoon Buster Bunny. Modeled from a photo found on internet.

  - All texture/material/part names are unique;

  - Turbosmooth with lvl 2 was applied and merged then uvw-unwrap'ed;

  - Simple materials, can be easily converted to other Render Engines (ex. Corona Renderer);

  - .psd texture with unwrap mask and painted layers is used.

3d printable. Model tall 19.5cm. If you need RAW model with unmerged turbosmooth modifier, please contact me.
